(  341) ! CVDAExx  : REAL    : scale heights of MACC-derived aerosol climatology
(  342) ! LAERADJDU: LOGICAL : T adjust MACC-derived DU climatology
(  343) ! LAERADCLI: LOGICAL : T if radiation uses the MACC-derived aerosol climatology
(  344) ! LApproxLwUpdate : LOGICAL : Update the longwave upwelling flux every
(  345) !                             timestep/gridpoint using the stored rate
(  346) !                             of change of the fluxes with respect to
(  347) !                             the surface upwelling longwave flux
(  348) ! LApproxSwUpdate : LOGICAL : Update the shortwave upwelling flux
(  349) !                             every gridpoint to account for the local
