(  353) !                             for solar zenith angle change
(  354) ! LCentredTimeSZA : LOGICAL : Compute solar zenith angle in radiation
(  355) !                             scheme half way between calls to
(  356) !                             radiation scheme (rather than previous
(  357) !                             behaviour, which is half way between
(  358) !                             calls plus half a model timestep)
(  359) ! LAverageSZA     : LOGICAL : Compute an averaged solar zenith angle
(  360) !                             across the time interval required
(  361) !                             (either a model timestep or a radiation
(  362) !                             timestep). Should be used with 
(  363) !                             LCentredTimeSZA=TRUE.
(  364) ! LUsePre2017Rad  : LOGICAL : Use the pre-2017 radiation scheme, rather 
(  365) !                             than the modular scheme contained in the
(  366) !                             separate "radiation" library.  Note that
(  367) !                             the radiation library may make use of the
(  368) !                             pre-2017 RRTM-G gas optics.
(  369) ! RCloud_Frac_Std : REAL    : Cloud water content horizontal fractional
(  370) !                             standard deviation in a gridbox
(  371) ! LInterpInCloudMean : LOGICAL : When interpolating model fields to
(  372) !                             radiation grid, interpolate in-cloud
(  373) !                             mean water contents?  Better
(  374) !                             conservation achieved by interpolating
(  375) !                             gridbox-means.
(  376) ! CGHGCLIMFILE : STRING :     Location of greenhouse gas climatology file,
(  377) !                             or empty if the default is to be used. If it
(  378) !                             starts with "." or "/" then a relative path
(  379) !                             is assumed, otherwise the default directory.
(  380) ! CGHGTIMESERIESFILE:STRING : Location of greenhouse gas timeseries
(  381) !                             file, or empty if it is to be worked out
(  382) !                             from the NSCEN, YOECMIP%NGHGCMIP and
(  383) !                             YOECMIP%NRCP variables. If it starts
(  384) !                             with "." or "/" then a relative path is
(  385) !                             assumed, otherwise the default
(  386) !                             directory.
(  387) ! CSOLARIRRADIANCEFILE:STRING:Location of Total Solar Irradiance file,
(  388) !                             or empty if the default is to be
(  389) !                             used. If it starts with "." or "/" then
(  390) !                             a relative path is assumed, otherwise
(  391) !                             the default directory.
(  392) ! NLWEMISS      : INTEGER :   Number of emissivity spectral intervals, set 
(  393) !                             according to the value of NEMISSSCHEME; traditionally
(  394) !                             this has always been 2: outside the IR window and within
(  395) ! NLWOUT        : INTEGER :   Number of spectral intervals to pass LW downwelling flux
(  396) !                             to RADHEATN; traditionally this was 1, but this led
(  397) !                             to errors with LAPPROXLWUPDATE=TRUE, which updated 
(  398) !                             fluxes using a single broadband emissivity. Now we can






NVFORTRAN (Version     24.5)          03/19/2025  06:54:25      page 8

(  399) !                             do approximate updates using full spectral emissivity.
